{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださり、ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 三期生 山口県出身🐡 21歳の"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "谷口愛季(たにぐちあいり)です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーー 5 ーーー"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobWZ1qlq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobe16wRO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 5th ANNIVERSARY LIVE"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう1ヶ月も経ってしまったそうです、、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだ余韻に浸ってたいです。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobh3b1KO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ステージに立つ度に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分が目指した アイドル という職業は"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんて素敵なんだって思わされます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メンバーの笑顔を見るだけで、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分まで幸せな気持ちになれます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何度も笑っている姿を見ているはずなのに、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心の底からぶわーーって幸せな気持ちが湧き上がってくるの凄くないですか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アイドルってすごいですね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私も、もっともっと自分の目指した"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アイドルというものを突き詰めていきたいです。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobMXNaT9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobypgWuP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob4eEb3w.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob7IUinj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobBiabrf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob0i35Qm.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「内側見た時どうするー？目合わす？しーの方見る？"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "目合わせたら笑っちゃいそう」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とか言ってたのに多分一番に泣いてた"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobUnBnU2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "I will be披露させていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "冒頭のダンストラック、ソファで登場している時"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "緊張なのか、わくわくからなのか分かりませんが、心臓が震えました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "忘れられないです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この時だけは、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私がこの会場の景色を独り占めしてるんだ！と"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しくなりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏の近道 もメンバー全員で披露することができて、とっても嬉しかったです♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先輩や後輩がラスサビを踊っているのが"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいくてかわいくてしょうがなかったです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しかったな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人生最大の「あいり〜！」でした！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてそして！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私、谷口愛季 21歳になりました〜"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobQALw7C.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "20歳ラストの私と、21歳最初の私"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どうでしたか〜？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "21歳の谷口愛季もよろしくお願いします🤜🏻🤛🏻"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobb6YeMs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobsMKqv8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobOXMLdi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobpVe4XS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobkZopRq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブをしてると"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "生きてる心地がしてとっても幸せです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日の"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "14th Single BACKS LIVE!!"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とっても素敵でしたね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2日目も盛り上がっていきましょう〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またねん👋🏻👋🏻"}], "source": "official"}